    },
    {
      "text": "Stop dragging dead weight.",
      "start": 388.44,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 393.04
    },
    {
      "text": "You set your financial freedom number.",
      "start": 391.0,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 395.32
    },
    {
      "text": "You know exactly where you're going.",
      "start": 393.04,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 397.4
    },
    {
      "text": "But then you look around.",
      "start": 395.32,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 399.52
    },
    {
      "text": "There's an expensive car with 3 years of",
      "start": 397.4,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 402.0
    },
    {
      "text": "payments left, a house that eats half",
      "start": 399.52,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "end": 404.76
    },
    {
      "text": "your income, a lifestyle you committed",
      "start": 402.0,
      "duration": 5.88,
      "end": 407.88
    },
    {
      "text": "to before you even knew what financial",
      "start": 404.76,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 409.72
    },
    {
      "text": "freedom was.",
      "start": 407.88,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 412.68
    },
    {
      "text": "These old decisions are now anchors.",
      "start": 409.72,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 415.0
    },
    {
      "text": "They're keeping you stuck.",
      "start": 412.68,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 416.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's where people mess up.",
      "start": 415.0,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 418.96
    },
    {
      "text": "They say, \"But I already bought the",
      "start": 416.96,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 419.96
    },
    {
      "text": "house.",
      "start": 418.96,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "end": 422.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I already signed to the lease. I already",
      "start": 419.96,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 423.44
    },
    {
      "text": "committed.\"",
      "start": 422.24,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 425.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So, they try to reach financial freedom",
      "start": 423.44,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 427.2
    },
    {
      "text": "while dragging all this weight behind",
      "start": 425.6,
      "duration": 2.52,
      "end": 428.12
    },
    {
      "text": "them.",
      "start": 427.2,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 430.2
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a name for this in psychology,",
      "start": 428.12,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 432.88
    },
    {
      "text": "the sunk cost fallacy.",
      "start": 430.2,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 434.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You keep doing something just because",
      "start": 432.88,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 436.44
    },
    {
      "text": "you already put time, money, and energy",
      "start": 434.56,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "end": 437.68
    },
    {
      "text": "into it,",
      "start": 436.44,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 440.52
    },
    {
      "text": "even when it's hurting you today.",
      "start": 437.68,
      "duration": 6.28,
      "end": 443.96
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's the truth. The past is past.",
      "start": 440.52,
      "duration": 6.52,
      "end": 447.04
    },
    {
      "text": "What you already spent has zero impact",
      "start": 443.96,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 449.08
    },
    {
      "text": "on what you should do next.",
      "start": 447.04,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 451.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask yourself one question.",
      "start": 449.08,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 453.24
    },
    {
      "text": "If I were starting fresh today, knowing",
      "start": 451.04,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 455.6
    },
    {
      "text": "what I know now, would I make this same",
      "start": 453.24,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 457.0
    },
    {
      "text": "decision?",
      "start": 455.6,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 459.6
    },
    {
      "text": "If no, it might be time to let it go.",
      "start": 457.0,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "end": 462.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Sell the house. Move somewhere cheaper.",
      "start": 459.6,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 464.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Get rid of the car.",
      "start": 462.52,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 467.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it feels like a step backward, but",
      "start": 464.16,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "end": 470.16
    },
    {
      "text": "it might be the very thing that sets you",
      "start": 467.16,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 471.36
    },
    {
      "text": "free.",
      "start": 470.16,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 474.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Trust me, I know this is hard. I spent 4",
      "start": 471.36,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 477.16
    },
    {
      "text": "years getting my bachelor's and 2 years",
      "start": 474.52,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 478.72
    },
    {
      "text": "getting my MBA.",
      "start": 477.16,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 481.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Built a corporate career.",
      "start": 478.72,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 482.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Then walked away to grow this YouTube",
      "start": 481.36,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "end": 483.96
    },
    {
      "text": "channel.",
      "start": 482.96,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "end": 486.04
    },
    {
      "text": "It felt like wasting everything.",
      "start": 483.96,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 488.6
    },
    {
      "text": "But those years weren't wasted. They",
      "start": 486.04,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 490.76
    },
    {
      "text": "just weren't my future.",
      "start": 488.6,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 492.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule six,",
      "start": 490.76,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 495.6
    },
    {
      "text": "invert. Always invert.",
      "start": 492.08,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 497.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Charlie Munger, one of the greatest",
      "start": 495.6,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "end": 500.76
    },
    {
      "text": "investors ever, had a simple rule.",
      "start": 497.68,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 502.36
    },
    {
      "text": "\"All I want to know is where I'm going",
      "start": 500.76,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "end": 503.4
    },
    {
      "text": "to die,",
      "start": 502.36,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "end": 505.2
    },
    {
      "text": "so I'll never go there.\"",
      "start": 503.4,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 508.0
    },
    {
      "text": "That's inversion. Instead of asking how",
      "start": 505.2,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 511.0
    },
    {
      "text": "to succeed, ask how to fail,",
      "start": 508.0,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 512.84
    },
    {
      "text": "then avoid those things.",
      "start": 511.0,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 514.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So instead of asking, \"How do I reach",
      "start": 512.84,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 517.2
    },
    {
      "text": "financial freedom?\" ask,",
      "start": 514.84,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 519.68
    },
    {
      "text": "\"How do I make sure I never reach it?\"",
      "start": 517.2,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 521.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Get a raise immediately and upgrade your",
      "start": 519.68,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 523.28
    },
    {
      "text": "car. Tell yourself you'll start saving",
      "start": 521.12,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 526.04
    },
    {
      "text": "next month for the next 10 years.",
      "start": 523.28,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 528.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Buy things to impress people you don't",
      "start": 526.04,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 529.48
    },
    {
      "text": "even like.",
      "start": 528.0,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 532.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Now just don't do those things.",
      "start": 529.48,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 534.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoiding stupidity beats chasing",
      "start": 532.56,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 536.72
    },
    {
      "text": "brilliance. You don't need to find the",
      "start": 534.8,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 538.72
    },
    {
      "text": "best investment. You don't need the",
      "start": 536.72,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 540.88
    },
    {
      "text": "perfect strategy. You just need to stop",
      "start": 538.72,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 543.04
    },
    {
      "text": "doing stupid things with your money.",
      "start": 540.88,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "end": 547.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule seven, don't diversify.",
      "start": 543.04,
      "duration": 6.68,
      "end": 549.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone tells you to diversify. Have",
      "start": 547.12,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 551.96
    },
    {
      "text": "multiple income streams. Start a few",
      "start": 549.72,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 554.92
    },
    {
      "text": "side hustles. Build passive income.",
      "start": 551.96,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "end": 557.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I get it. It sounds smart.",
      "start": 554.92,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 560.72
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's the problem. You can't master",
      "start": 557.64,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "end": 563.48
    },
    {
      "text": "freelancing, sell stuff online, and",
      "start": 560.72,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 565.68
    },
    {
      "text": "learn day trading at the same time. It",
      "start": 563.48,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 567.04
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't work.",
      "start": 565.68,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 569.12
    },
    {
      "text": "You end up being average at all of them,",
      "start": 567.04,
      "duration": 6.76,
      "end": 573.8
    },
    {
      "text": "making like $200 here, $150 there.",
      "start": 569.12,
      "duration": 6.84,
      "end": 575.96
    },
    {
      "text": "6 months go by and you're making $400",
      "start": 573.8,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 578.92
    },
    {
      "text": "total from these three different things.",
      "start": 575.96,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 581.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Every rich person you know got rich by",
      "start": 578.92,
      "duration": 6.56,
      "end": 585.48
    },
    {
      "text": "doing one thing extremely well,",
      "start": 581.52,
      "duration": 6.04,
      "end": 587.56
    },
    {
      "text": "not by diversifying.",
      "start": 585.48,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 590.88
    },
    {
      "text": "You get rich by focusing on one thing.",
      "start": 587.56,
      "duration": 6.6,
      "end": 594.16
    },
    {
      "text": "You stay rich by diversifying.",
      "start": 590.88,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 596.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Diversification is for protecting",
      "start": 594.16,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 597.32
    },
    {
      "text": "wealth.",
      "start": 596.32,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 599.72
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't have wealth yet. So, what are",
      "start": 597.32,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 602.4
    },
    {
      "text": "we really diversifying?",
      "start": 599.72,
      "duration": 5.92,
      "end": 605.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So, here's what you do instead. Pick one",
      "start": 602.4,
      "duration": 6.92,
      "end": 609.32
    },
    {
      "text": "thing. Get scary good at it. Make real",
      "start": 605.64,
      "duration": 6.48,
      "end": 612.12
    },
    {
      "text": "money from it. Then, you can start",
      "start": 609.32,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 614.32
    },
    {
      "text": "thinking about diversifying.",
      "start": 612.12,
      "duration": 6.72,
      "end": 618.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule eight. At $0, you are the",
      "start": 614.32,
      "duration": 5.92,
      "end": 620.24
    },
    {
      "text": "investment.",
      "start": 618.84,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 622.36
    },
    {
      "text": "When I was starting, I spent hours",
      "start": 620.24,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 624.08
    },
    {
      "text": "researching investments.",
      "start": 622.36,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 627.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Should I buy stocks, real estate, gold?",
      "start": 624.08,
      "duration": 6.68,
      "end": 630.76
    },
    {
      "text": "What's the perfect asset allocation? 80%",
      "start": 627.68,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 633.12
    },
    {
      "text": "stocks, 20% bonds.",
      "start": 630.76,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 636.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd read for hours, compared returns,",
      "start": 633.12,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "end": 639.52
    },
    {
      "text": "studied different strategies.",
      "start": 636.36,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 641.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Then one day I realized how stupid this",
      "start": 639.52,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "end": 642.4
    },
    {
      "text": "was.",
      "start": 641.44,
      "duration": 2.52,
      "end": 643.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I had roughly a thousand dollars to my",
      "start": 642.4,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 646.84
    },
    {
      "text": "name. Even if I got a 20% return, that's",
      "start": 643.96,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "end": 649.6
    },
    {
      "text": "$200 for an entire year.",
      "start": 646.84,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 651.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I wish somebody grabbed me by the",
      "start": 649.6,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 653.8
    },
    {
      "text": "shoulders, shook me really hard, and",
      "start": 651.36,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 654.8
    },
    {
      "text": "said,",
      "start": 653.8,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 657.04
    },
    {
      "text": "\"What the hell are you doing?",
      "start": 654.8,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 658.44
    },
    {
      "text": "You're broke.",
      "start": 657.04,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 661.28
    },
    {
      "text": "A broke person has one asset, time.",
      "start": 658.44,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 663.28
    },
    {
      "text": "You're spending 10 hours a week to make",
      "start": 661.28,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "end": 666.92
    },
    {
      "text": "$4. That's 40 cents an hour. McDonald's",
      "start": 663.28,
      "duration": 7.16,
      "end": 670.44
    },
    {
      "text": "pays 20 times that. Go do anything",
      "start": 666.92,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 671.96
    },
    {
      "text": "else.\"",
      "start": 670.44,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 674.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's what I should have done instead.",
      "start": 671.96,
      "duration": 6.36,
      "end": 678.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Put that $1,000 into a certification, a",
      "start": 674.76,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "end": 680.6
    },
    {
      "text": "course, a skill.",
      "start": 678.32,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 682.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Within a year, I could have been making",
      "start": 680.6,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 685.08
    },
    {
      "text": "$1,000 more per month.",
      "start": 682.08,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 687.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not a 10% return.",
      "start": 685.08,
      "duration": 6.08,
      "end": 691.16
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a 1,200%",
      "start": 687.64,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 692.32
    },
    {
      "text": "return.",
      "start": 691.16,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 694.84
    },
    {
      "text": "The stock market can wait. You are the",
      "start": 692.32,
      "duration": 6.44,
      "end": 698.76
    },
    {
      "text": "asset. Invest in yourself first.",
      "start": 694.84,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 700.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule nine,",
      "start": 698.76,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 703.36
    },
    {
      "text": "create imbalance in your life.",
      "start": 700.24,
      "duration": 5.76,
      "end": 706.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone talks about work-life balance.",
      "start": 703.36,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 707.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me tell you something. Everything",
      "start": 706.0,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "end": 711.64
    },
    {
      "text": "worthwhile in life is created because of",
      "start": 707.88,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "end": 713.4
    },
    {
      "text": "imbalance.",
      "start": 711.64,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 715.32
    },
    {
      "text": "When you pass that difficult exam, you",
      "start": 713.4,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 717.6
    },
    {
      "text": "didn't study balanced. You locked",
      "start": 715.32,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 719.16
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself in a room for weeks and went",
      "start": 717.6,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 721.56
    },
    {
      "text": "all in. When someone gets in incredible",
      "start": 719.16,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 724.12
    },
    {
      "text": "shape, they're not living balanced.",
      "start": 721.56,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 726.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Strict diet, gym everyday, saying no to",
      "start": 724.12,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 729.12
    },
    {
      "text": "everything for months.",
      "start": 726.84,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 731.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Balance is a lie sold to people who want",
      "start": 729.12,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 733.84
    },
    {
      "text": "to stay comfortable.",
      "start": 731.52,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 736.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Work-life balance is for later.",
      "start": 733.84,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "end": 740.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Right now, it's work-work balance.",
      "start": 736.24,
      "duration": 7.32,
      "end": 743.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You can have a hard four years now",
      "start": 740.24,
      "duration": 6.56,
      "end": 746.8
    },
    {
      "text": "or a hard 40 years later.",
      "start": 743.56,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 748.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That was the last rule. If you want more",
      "start": 746.8,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 750.68
    },
    {
      "text": "videos like this, check out the playlist",
      "start": 748.64,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 752.76
    },
    {
      "text": "on your screen. Thanks for watching.",
      "start": 750.68,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 756.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll see you in the next one.",
      "start": 752.76,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 756.0
    }
  ]
}